dent :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ebd8942f-54d2-577f-b680-a6f2a8658e9c" :question/math-academy-id "q-275515" :question/problem "Calculate $AB+AC$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -3 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB+AC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$4$</td><td>$3$</td><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td><td>$-2$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-1$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$5$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law \n\n$$\nAB+AC=A(B+C).\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $B+C$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B+C & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB+AC & =A(B+C) \\\\  & =A{I}_{3} \\\\  & =A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292859 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b078db42-ad93-5fd2-9dbb-b3b4553a9c0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291398}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b078db42-ad93-5fd2-9dbb-b3b4553a9c0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291398} :answer-field/id #uuid "02615eb4-e49b-59d7-b652-4ca3a6d8d8db" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291740} {:answer-field/choices [{:an