4 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345111 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ee09dde-9c18-57ab-a901-5cb48ac60b24" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342366} {:answer/id #uuid "acddba2b-17ca-56dc-8396-ff2e31f12d69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343760} {:answer/id #uuid "b1e2f292-6220-5944-8085-85b72df63404" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343799} {:answer/id #uuid "b265b790-4d44-5977-8ab0-7c363f5b3089" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343806} {:answer/id #uuid "e00b655d-026d-51b0-a39a-995529f592be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344204}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e00b655d-026d-51b0-a39a-995529f592be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344204} :answer-field/id #uuid "67aaf379-1aa5-553d-babc-0323dc49f059" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344669}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "80c9e376-8c41-538a-b47f-6281460b7dd2" :question/math-academy-id "q-75635" :question/problem "Calculate $CB+CA$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & -\\sqr