{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$6$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law \n\n$$\nAB+AC=A(B+C).\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $B+C$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B+C & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB+AC & =A(B+C) \\\\  & =A{I}_{3} \\\\  & =A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 5 & 7 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186604611 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1516c745-8e80-5a7b-93ce-85215241503b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604224}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1516c745-8e80-5a7b-93ce-85215241503b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604224} :answer-field/id #uuid "169265c9-3fed-569e-b3a9-fe73999a7f2f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604480} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "df4b67bb-9c2c-5724-804b-5039bbface28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604443}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df4b67bb-9c2c-5724-804b-5039bbface28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604443} :answer-field/id #uuid "d6d13a5a-4a6e-5634-82ce-6f12b3913a5d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604544} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c3db9c0-68bb-5109-b381-1189a190ea09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604327}] :ans