nswer/id #uuid "9169b9a8-19ad-5f2a-9986-7fc4bf27a992" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -10 & 2 \\\\ -14 & 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628952} :answer-field/id #uuid "905a2bda-b4cb-5f0c-998a-55ab2afc9a43" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629194}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e2956fb8-8468-580b-b6a5-e7a3c2e541b6" :question/math-academy-id "q-130281" :question/problem "Find $AB+CB$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -5 & 1 \\\\ -7 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law\n\n$$\nAB+CB=(A+C)B.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $A+C$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+C & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =2{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB+CB & =(A+C)B \\\\  & =2{I}_{3}B \\\\  & =2B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -10 & 2 \\\\ -14 & 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717470 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "890fa9d6-3c92-5afd-9b8a-13b62013ff65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3} + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717478}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "890fa9d6-3c92-5afd-9b8a-13b62013ff65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3} + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717478} :answer-field/id #uuid "4820a725-21b2-5d95-96e1-7de046824b72" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id