\ 1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & - \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ -2 & 2 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe table gives the entries of $AC-BC$. Fill in the missing entries.\n\n| Row | Column 1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | $2$ |\n| 2 | $-3$ | {{field-3}} | $\\sqrt{5}$ |\n| 3 | $\\sqrt{2} + 2$ | $-1$ | {{field-4}} |\n" :question/worked-solution "Factor out the shared right factor $C$ without moving it to the left:\n\n$$\nAC-BC=(A-B)C.\n$$\n\nSubtract corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nA-B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe result is not a scalar multiple of the identity. Multiply each row of $A-B$ by each column of $C$. The three output rows are, respectively, row 1 plus row 2 of $C$, row 3 minus row 2 of $C$, and row 1 minus row 3 of $C$. For the missing entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} (AC-BC)_{11}&=1\\cdot\\sqrt{2}+1\\cdot1+0\\cdot(-2)=\\sqrt{2}+1, \\\\ (AC-BC)_{12}&=1\\cdot1+1\\cdot(-\\sqrt{3})+0\\cdot2=1-\\sqrt{3}, \\\\ (AC-BC)_{22}&=0\\cdot1+(-1)(-\\sqrt{3})+1\\cdot2=\\sqrt{3}+2, \\\\ (AC-BC)_{33}&=1\\cdot2+0\\cdot0+(-1)\\sqrt{5}=2-\\sqrt{5}. \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus the complete matrix is\n\n$$\nAC-BC=\\begin{bmatrix}1 + \\sqrt{2} & 1 - \\sqrt{3} & 2 \\\\ -3 & \\sqrt{3} + 2 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2} + 2 & -1 & 2 - \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717483 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32727c35-b087-587e-95bc-c023683ef155" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717468}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32727c35-b087-587e-95bc-c023683ef155" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717468} :answer-field/id #uuid "2dc9e755-aee5-5c9e-8286-58e87897f1cf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717467} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "064944f6-2ec9-52fe-b862-887092780e91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717464}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "064944f6-2ec9-52fe-b862-887092780e91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717464} :answer-field/id #uuid "54c52198-f06e-52a3-a631-1b61a1187358" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717473} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c2de559-ec55-547f-a156-36e05b276aa3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717481}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9c2de559-ec55-547f-a156-36e05b276aa3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717481} :answer-field/id #uuid "f700a76f-88b5-58d0-ac17-1fad462d5d33" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717486}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d0572715-7415-58c8-af0e-c23c5eaeab1b" :question/problem "Calculate $CB-CA$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe table gives the entries of $CB-CA$. Fill in the missing entries.\n\n| Row | Column 1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | {{field-1}} | $2$ | $0$ |\n| 2 | $-4$ | $0$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 3 | {{field-3}} | $-6$ | $-2$ |\n" :question/worked-solution "Both products have the shared left factor $C$. Keep the subtraction in the order $B-A$:\n\n$$\nCB-CA=C(B-A).\n$$\n\nSubtract corresponding entries of $A$ from $B$. Each diagonal difference is $-2$ and each off-diagonal difference is $0$:\n\n$$\nB-A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}=-2I_3.\n$$\n\nTherefore multiply every entry of $C$ by $-2$:\n\n$$\nCB-CA=C(-2I_3)=-2C=\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\sqrt{2} & 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2 & -6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIn particular, the missing entries are $-2\\sqrt{2}$, $2\\sqrt{3}$, and $2$, in row order."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717484 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1808d49c-c9c9-5838-80ca-0c0d61264ec5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717466} {:answer/id #uuid "40c85861-9ed3-5600-9757-157d1b8fd6dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717469} {:answer/id #uuid "5c0a1080-7e20-5999-9519-3b08614e54b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717474} {:answer/id #uuid "667b2e8a-cee8-5486-a027-8feac086aa8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717476} {:answer/id #uuid "9a034b15-8215-5bd6-a13a-7a50ea6dd9db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717480}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "40c85861-9ed3-5600-9757-157d1b8fd6dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717469} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b8ecaff-be96-5094-ba3c-8c3956197c1c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717479}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e27ab8e5-06c4-561d-8fca-53ea44b21aa8" :question/problem "Calculate $AB+AC$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nChoose the resulting matrix." :question/worked-solution "Factor out the shared left factor $A$, keeping it on the left:\n\n$$\nAB+AC=A(B+C).\n$$\n\nAdd corresponding entries of $B$ and $C$. The diagonal entries each sum to $1$ and all other entries sum to $0$:\n\n$$\nB+C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=I_3.\n$$\n\nMultiplication by the identity leaves a matrix unchanged:\n\n$$\nAB+AC=AI_3=A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717716 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8be4f047-5657-5da8-8e29-6b0be634ef22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717731} {:answer/id #uuid "164a62dd-18bd-41be-a8bc-9fada0def7bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186746831}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8be4f047-5657-5da8-8e29-6b0be634ef22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717731} :answer-field/id #uuid "52b90642-cc41-52e0-9665-aac430198080" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717727} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbd13ef5-906d-5fd8-a0a2-a9d6753354b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717750} {:answer/id #uuid "ec081c2a-ade4-4f89-b906-a7771e1e4ea5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186746832}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fbd13ef5-906d-5fd8-a0a2-a9d6753354b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717750} :answer-field/id #uuid "975b0ab2-086c-5ecc-8a56-006de5111d87" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717733} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a039df5e-fc19-593b-a5be-f78d1cf80ff8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717736} {:answer/id #uuid "cd65e1fb-30ee-45ff-9a67-32a9665861f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186746833}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a039df5e-fc19-593b-a5be-f78d1cf80ff8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717736} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e5e81ae-6502-541a-8be8-f47da9088e32" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717735}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0241b95f-2b75-5cc3-97c9-9862fe4bf540" :question/problem "Calculate $BC-BA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\sqrt{5} & 1 & -1 \\\\ -2 & - \\sqrt{5} & 1 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BC-BA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$-3$</td><td>$3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-9$</td><td>$- 3 \\sqrt{3}$</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Keep the common factor $B$ on the left and preserve the order of the subtraction:\n\n$$\nBC-BA=B(C-A).\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nC-A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe combined matrix is $-3I_3$. Multiply every entry of $B$ by $-3$.\n\n$$\nBC-BA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\sqrt{5} & -3 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 3 \\sqrt{5} & -3 \\\\ -9 & - 3 \\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717720 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ce25edb8-5945-52f8-b052-c4b64ad158f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce25edb8-5945-52f8-b052-c4b64ad158f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717743} :answer-field/id #uuid "5576cfea-a5c2-59ee-b9b4-9cd27de13e9e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717728} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a511cacb-e96c-5985-aac5-68bf61969dfd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717737}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a511cacb-e96c-5985-aac5-68bf61969dfd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717737} :answer-field/id #uuid "94665fc1-acb7-5ec4-a5fe-ce28158f5533" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717732} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c7549fb8-f8a0-56f0-bd46-b6b788aab2e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c7549fb8-f8a0-56f0-bd46-b6b788aab2e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717741} :answer-field/id #uuid "f4c2d967-12d0-5846-a5b4-c5207c845253" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717749}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "27e48bbd-ab13-5e82-87ed-cecbb766b597" :question/problem "Calculate $BA+CA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 5 & 1 - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} + 3 \\\\ -1 & \\sqrt{2} & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BA+CA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$- \\sqrt{3}$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$1$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Keep the common factor $A$ on the right and preserve the order of the addition:\n\n$$\nBA+CA=(B+C)A.\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nB+C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 3 & 1 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2 & \\sqrt{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse row-by-column multiplication on the shorter product $(B+C)A$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(BA+CA)_{21}&=0=0 \\\\ (BA+CA)_{22}&=(\\sqrt{3})(1)=\\sqrt{3} \\\\ (BA+CA)_{31}&=0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nBA+CA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & - \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717722 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3769c9a2-a670-50fb-bc13-bdbcf121366d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717724}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #u