trix-answer-label\">$BC-BA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$-6$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$4$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Keep the common factor $B$ on the left and preserve the order of the subtraction:\n\n$$\nBC-BA=B(C-A).\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nC-A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse row-by-column multiplication on the shorter product $B(C-A)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(BC-BA)_{11}&=0=0 \\\\ (BC-BA)_{12}&=(- \\sqrt{5})(2)=- 2 \\sqrt{5} \\\\ (BC-BA)_{23}&=0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nBC-BA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & - 2 \\sqrt{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717738 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "42a988f6-93de-58fa-8cdc-e4c2429b423e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717725}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "42a988f6-93de-58fa-8cdc-e4c2429b423e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717725} :answer-field/id #uuid "4898b25e-c490-5911-93b9-d24db4b4831c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717726} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69f7f8e7-9f20-5a26-9f56-654350e247d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717729}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "69f7f8e7-9f20-5a26-9f56-654350e247d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717729} :answer-field/id #uuid "babfacd7-0809-585c-a007-5ff4fedcc212" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 